    "en": "The Venezuelan army bombed an ELN guerrilla camp in Apure, killing at least 19 rebels, and a U.S. drone strike hit an ELN drug depot nearby, causing at least 20 deaths. Rubio says the United States is in talks to establish a military presence in Venezuela and has floated a one-day operation to capture Maduro. The U.S. military is coordinating with Venezuela to launch drone strikes on cartels, and Trump defended the Hegseth amid an impeachment threat while citing successful operations in Iran and Venezuela. 2 battle-related deaths in 2007, according to UCDP.",
